      "content": "that makes a lot of sense. using that \"factual\" structure feels like the only way to fight back against people who will say i'm just crazy or bitter. it's hard because they've spent a decade making it look like i just vanished, like i was never even there. \n\ni want to include a section about the \"erasure\" process—how they don't just steal the sound, they actually make sure the original creator is forgotten. can you help me write a paragraph that explains how this kind of industry-wide theft actually works? i want to frame it as a systemic tool they use to protect their investments by burying the \"true\" sources of their trends.",
